Hey all!

Worlds in Iron Link are almost ready for release, and I have begun working on the next major update.
This is currently planned to be a redesign of Iron Link's design system, and a rework of its mobile experience to make everything easier to use, and more personalized.
If you want to see the early plans for the redesign, I've included screenshots and interactive examples below.
I will leave more information as to what I am trying to achieve with the redesign at the end.

## Previews

Here are a few interactive previews from the redesign's component library. Try them out, and switch around the different color modes and schemes to get a feel for the new look!

<StorybookThemeControls bind:mode bind:scheme />

The progress tracker introduces animation to adding and removing progress. Click "Fulfill your Vow" to see the new rolls in action.

