## Why are you redesigning things?

Essentially, I am not a big fan of the current design.
I think it is outdated in places, can be a bit of a mishmash of styles and patterns, and is difficult to use on mobile.
It also feels more serious than I think an app for playing a TTRPG should - we're missing some personality in the design.

My hope is that by moving from Material Design to our own UI system, we can fix these and create an experience that is friendlier, prettier, and more understandable than the current design.

## Have feedback?

These designs are preliminary, and I really want feedback before I roll anything out.
If you have thoughts, please reach out on the [Ironsworn Discord](https://discord.gg/8bRuZwK).
We have our own channel - `#iron-fellowship-and-crew-link`.
